  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="8cb61b91-f898-4326-a943-82a15a7e45cf"><problem><para>
      <para><emphasis>Select three </emphasis>expressions that are perfect squares.</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>["\\(9x^2+24x+16\\)", "\\((7-3x)^2\\)", "\\((1-2x)(-2x+1)\\)"]</para><para>
      <para>The correct answers are: \(9x^2+24x+16\), \((7-3x)^2\), \((1-2x)(-2x+1)\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
